{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56395","headline":"闺情 · 常浩","name":"闺情","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"门前昨夜信初来，见说行人卒未回。\n谁家楼上吹横笛，偏送愁声向妾哀。\n（均见明刻本宋陈应时《吟窗杂录》卷三十《古今才妇》。\n又见《名媛诗归》卷十四。\n胡伟《宫词》收末句。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"常浩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56395.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56395","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}